# Rust build output
/target/
**/target/
# Frontend component-test coverage output.
/web/coverage/
# Local scale-harness reports; CI publishes these as workflow artifacts.
/perf-results/
# Generated shell completions + man pages (`cargo xtask packaging`). Deliberately NOT under
# target/: `tauri.conf.json` names these paths as literal strings under `bundle.linux.deb.files`
# and cannot interpolate a `[build] target-dir` override, which is a normal thing for a developer
# to set (and is set on at least one machine here).
/packaging/
# Spike-generated artefacts (regeneratable — see spike READMEs)
spikes/**/out-*
